WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.990
- I am blown away by how fearlessly

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:04.100
you embraced this transformation.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.190
- Right, exactly, I feel like radiant,

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:10.220
and beautiful, and sexy, and confident.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.270
I had it in me but you all brought

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.143
it out and I really appreciate it.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:21.130
I just feel like I had
pretty much given up

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:26.130
on kind, genuine people,
like really I did,

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.050
because everyone that I met
I felt like they pitied me,

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:31.860
and they looked down on me, and you know

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.680
they expected me to be someone else,

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.300
more black, less white,
more gay, less gay.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.030
So I basically just accepted
that the real world sucks

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:44.430
and family doesn't exist,
unconditional love doesn't exist,

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:45.890
but you all just showed me that.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:48.790
It's beautiful and sexy
to care for yourself.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:49.623
- Yeah it is.

00:00:49.623 --> 00:00:50.642
- You know what I mean?

00:00:50.642 --> 00:00:53.720
And it's like cute and
confident to just be black,

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.210
and be gay, and be a
woman, and what that is,

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.017
is me, and I'm always that.

00:00:58.017 --> 00:00:58.930
- Yes.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.403
- Bobby, oh my goodness.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:05.490
I felt connected to you from the beginning

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:09.390
and it's inspiring for
someone with my background,

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:11.810
our background, because it means that,

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.670
like the sky is the limit,

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:16.800
and you're just actually
a really amazing person.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.920
- Thank you for letting
me in and allowing me

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:21.843
to be a part of your story, I love you.

00:01:23.328 --> 00:01:24.950
- You now know your identity.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:26.560
You know who you are.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:31.560
- Honestly, you are a huge
black role model for me.

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.910
I look up to you so much.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:42.320
And to meet you I was really scared.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:44.840
I was intimidated, 'cause I thought that,

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.890
like everyone else who looked like me,

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:51.210
you were just gonna be
like, oh she's not enough.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:56.210
She's weird, and you were so
warm to me, and encouraging.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:01.590
You are exactly what I wanna
be in terms of a black person.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:05.220
You are yourself and that's beautiful.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:08.350
It took me my whole life to realize that

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:10.433
and it is just so impactful to me.

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:20.120
- I can't say how much I
love you and appreciate you.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.360
- [Jess] Thank you so much.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.997
- [Karamo] Now, none of
us don't wanna leave you.

00:02:23.997 --> 00:02:26.219
Like, can we get invited to this party?

00:02:26.219 --> 00:02:27.052
- Surprise.

00:02:27.052 --> 00:02:28.060
- This is us.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:28.893
- Yay.

00:02:28.893 --> 00:02:29.726
- Let's hug it out.

00:02:29.726 --> 00:02:30.790
- Yeah let's hug it out.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:31.840
- [Group] Hug it out.

00:02:33.828 --> 00:02:34.880
- [Anthony] Have fun tonight.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:35.713
- I will.

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:39.500
